flowchart TD
    A[Structured input
(4 diagnostic modules)] --> B[Signal normalization
(qualitative notes)]
    B --> C{Module-by-module
elimination}
    C -->|Hard stop| D[Remove path]
    C -->|Risk flag| E[Keep path
(marked high risk)]
    C -->|Support signal| F[Keep path
(aligned)]
    D --> G[Remaining viable paths]
    E --> G
    F --> G
    G --> H{Signals sufficient?}
    H -->|Yes| I[Recommend main path
+ alternatives]
    H -->|No| J[Recommend iteration
/ more data]
    I --> K[Decision report
(human-in-the-loop)]
    J --> K
